Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: More irrigation is needed.

asr-001933
01:55:36.760 --> 01:55:37.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But I...

asr-001934
01:55:37.780 --> 01:55:38.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I...

asr-001935
01:55:38.940 --> 01:55:43.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I propose to NIA to concentrate more on water impounding

asr-001936
01:55:43.880 --> 01:55:50.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and retention projects in the coming years, no?

asr-001937
01:55:50.100 --> 01:55:53.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because every time, every rainy season,

asr-001938
01:55:54.760 --> 01:55:56.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sobra-sobra yung ulan natin.

asr-001939
01:55:56.480 --> 01:55:57.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya lang,

asr-001940
01:55:57.720 --> 01:55:59.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: toyo talagang walang-wala.

asr-001941
01:55:59.660 --> 01:56:00.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, parang sabi ko,

asr-001942
01:56:00.780 --> 01:56:02.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: if we continue on doing...

asr-001943
01:56:02.900 --> 01:56:05.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: on adding more irrigation,

asr-001944
01:56:05.740 --> 01:56:07.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: makadals and others,

asr-001945
01:56:08.080 --> 01:56:10.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pero kung wala naman dadaloy na tubig, sayang din.

asr-001946
01:56:11.140 --> 01:56:13.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, yun lang.

asr-001947
01:56:13.560 --> 01:56:17.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: While you just like to ask for your opinion or position on this,

asr-001948
01:56:18.380 --> 01:56:20.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: do you think this will be a better choice?

asr-001949
01:56:20.440 --> 01:56:23.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because I think we'll be hitting two birds with one stone here.

asr-001950
01:56:23.620 --> 01:56:24.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We'll be providing irrigation.

asr-001951
01:56:24.980 --> 01:56:27.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We will be mitigating flood also.

asr-001952
01:56:27.720 --> 01:56:30.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, it will be for flood mitigation.

asr-001953
01:56:31.100 --> 01:56:35.600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At the same time, we will have the needed water during the dry days,

asr-001954
01:56:35.680 --> 01:56:37.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: especially now na meron tayo mga...

asr-001955
01:56:37.560 --> 01:56:39.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung ilin ninyo na, as mentioned earlier,

asr-001956
01:56:39.240 --> 01:56:40.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nagiging every three years na.

asr-001957
01:56:41.140 --> 01:56:43.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Instead of the usual, sabi nyo kanina, ten years,

asr-001958
01:56:43.400 --> 01:56:43.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nagiging five years.

asr-001959
01:56:44.560 --> 01:56:53.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, would you also endorse or suggest that we pursue that direction

asr-001960
01:56:53.720 --> 01:56:56.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: of having more impounding, having more...

asr-001961
01:56:57.720 --> 01:56:59.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: dams in water retention facilities?

asr-001962
01:57:00.140 --> 01:57:01.480
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-001963
01:57:03.280 --> 01:57:06.220
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Along that, pati aquaculture will thrive, sir.

asr-001964
01:57:06.940 --> 01:57:10.800
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Definitely, nung pumasok ako, Mr. Chair, sa DA,

asr-001965
01:57:11.380 --> 01:57:14.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I already mentioned to many na

asr-001966
01:57:14.080 --> 01:57:17.140
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: we are actually throwing away water.

asr-001967
01:57:18.720 --> 01:57:20.860
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ang lipis ho ng Pilipinas.

asr-001968
01:57:21.800 --> 01:57:24.200
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kung ang Palawan, mas manipis pa.

asr-001969
01:57:25.100 --> 01:57:27.200
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kung humulan ho sa gitna ng Palawan,

asr-001970
01:57:27.720 --> 01:57:32.720
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: ang tubig na ulan na yun, in 12 hours na sa dagat na.

asr-001971
01:57:33.480 --> 01:57:35.460
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sa Luzon naman, ang calculation ko,

asr-001972
01:57:36.100 --> 01:57:39.700
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: kung humulan sa gitna ng Luzon, kung may linya sa gitna,

asr-001973
01:57:39.980 --> 01:57:44.480
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: ng malakas, in 48 hours na sa dagat na yung tubig na yan.

asr-001974
01:57:45.220 --> 01:57:46.060
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Tapon ho yun.

asr-001975
01:57:46.340 --> 01:57:50.220
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kung lalagyan ho natin ng halaga yung tubig na humulan

asr-001976
01:57:50.220 --> 01:57:54.120
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: at napunta sa dagat,

asr-001977
01:57:54.120 --> 01:57:57.700
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I computed it at 500 billion pesos a year yun.

asr-001978
01:57:57.720 --> 01:58:01.000
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: A worth of water ang tinatapon natin.

asr-001979
01:58:01.200 --> 01:58:06.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, ang ganda ho ng inyong push, Senator JV, Mr. Chair,

asr-001980
01:58:06.600 --> 01:58:12.540
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: and I fully support na kailangan talaga natin ng warm water impounding.

asr-001981
01:58:12.940 --> 01:58:16.880
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: We have so much water to impound and we should impound it.

asr-001982
01:58:17.300 --> 01:58:21.800
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And NIA, in my opinion, should concentrate on the big ticket items

asr-001983
01:58:21.800 --> 01:58:26.840
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: like dams, water impounding, and all the major canals

asr-001984
01:58:26.840 --> 01:58:27.700
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: and water impounding.

asr-001985
01:58:27.720 --> 01:58:31.720
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Water waste for our agriculture, Mr. Chair.

asr-001986
01:58:31.900 --> 01:58:33.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you for that, Secretary Laurel.

asr-001987
01:58:33.860 --> 01:58:36.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Likewise, even DPWH, Secretary Dizon,

asr-001988
01:58:37.060 --> 01:58:45.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I also suggested that instead of us concentrating on this flood mitigation project,

asr-001989
01:58:45.780 --> 01:58:47.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: or dating flood control, flood mitigation,

asr-001990
01:58:48.020 --> 01:58:50.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para nangyari sisementohan lahat ng ano,

asr-001991
01:58:51.460 --> 01:58:53.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: lahat na pwedeng simentohan nating water waste,

asr-001992
01:58:53.800 --> 01:58:56.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para mawala lahat ng tubig, ma-push back,

asr-001993
01:58:56.340 --> 01:58:57.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nangyayari,

asr-001994
