Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para maidagdago natin, so that we would consider.

asr-002032
02:00:58.740 --> 02:01:05.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Anyway, the Vice Chair of Finance, Francis Pangilinan, will recommend, pero siguro,

asr-002033
