Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: but probably could already brief us today, kung ano po yung mga major programs that you think that would lead,

asr-002034
02:01:16.080 --> 02:01:20.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung hindi pwedeng mawala, kung bagas sa inyong plano next, sa susunod na taon.

asr-002035
