DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, thank you.

asr-002036
02:01:24.720 --> 02:01:28.900
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yan nga namin yung expanded fertilizer assistance of about 8.7B,

asr-002037
02:01:29.680 --> 02:01:35.300
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: and yung mga hybrid solar-powered pump irrigation system,

asr-002038
02:01:35.300 --> 02:01:41.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: irrigation systems for fish production, retarding basin, basically for water impounding din talaga,

asr-002039
02:01:41.880 --> 02:01:43.540
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: yung mga SWIP projects namin.

asr-002040
02:01:44.840 --> 02:01:49.420
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Meron din kami yung request na sa masagana agri-food infrastructure modernization,

asr-002041
02:01:50.140 --> 02:01:53.760
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: mga post-harvest facilities, dahil nga, lalo na pag El Nino,

asr-002042
