asr-002043
02:02:02.080 --> 02:02:05.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Marami pang iba, but we will submit the list, Mr. Chair,

asr-002044
02:02:05.580 --> 02:02:09.960
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: para for your guidance and to the good Senator J.B. Ejercito. Thank you, sir.

