Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung mga, yung mga,

asr-002050
02:02:24.720 --> 02:02:28.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang medyo malaki, pero we'll do our best, no?

asr-002051
02:02:28.620 --> 02:02:30.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siyempre, ayaw naman nating mawala, no?

asr-002052
02:02:31.280 --> 02:02:36.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because I think, yung itong Middle East crisis have taught us lesson,

asr-002053
02:02:36.200 --> 02:02:41.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na talaga, we really have to strengthen our food security and yung self-reliance, no?

asr-002054
