Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Just like to ask, continues naman yung ating, yung ating po,

asr-002057
02:02:54.720 --> 02:02:58.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: fisher folks, especially in the disputed areas, no?

asr-002058
02:02:58.920 --> 02:03:02.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Can you, ano, can you just briefly, ano na, kung paano yung operation po natin doon?

asr-002059
