Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: How many vessels are assigned?

asr-002060
02:03:06.300 --> 02:03:07.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: How many personnel?

asr-002061
02:03:08.000 --> 02:03:16.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: How many liters of gasoline are being distributed to our fisher folks in this area,

asr-002062
02:03:16.860 --> 02:03:18.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: dun sa West Philippine Sea area?

