02:47:16.640 --> 02:47:18.580
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: although ang gusto daw nila

asr-003117
02:47:18.580 --> 02:47:20.660
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: is to promote exports,

asr-003118
02:47:21.640 --> 02:47:22.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: of what?

asr-003119
02:47:22.880 --> 02:47:25.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We cannot just promote exports biglaan.

asr-003120
02:47:25.200 --> 02:47:27.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We have to strengthen the industry.

asr-003121
02:47:27.200 --> 02:47:29.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: To be able to promote the exports.

asr-003122
02:47:29.920 --> 02:47:30.840
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So for the meantime,

asr-003123
02:47:31.220 --> 02:47:32.820
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: pabayaan lang po natin na

asr-003124
02:47:32.820 --> 02:47:35.660
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: let the peso fall

asr-003125
02:47:35.660 --> 02:47:37.740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: to where it may against the dollar.

asr-003126
02:47:38.000 --> 02:47:40.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kawawa po lahat ng kababayan natin.

asr-003127
02:47:40.220 --> 02:47:40.880
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kawawa po.

asr-003128
02:47:41.420 --> 02:47:43.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: From fuel, from gasoline,

asr-003129
02:47:43.320 --> 02:47:45.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: from imported products,

asr-003130
02:47:45.340 --> 02:47:46.080
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: lahat ay imported.

asr-003131
02:47:46.320 --> 02:47:48.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Pati sa agrikultura na yun,

asr-003132
02:47:48.660 --> 02:47:50.860
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: pesticides and fertilizers, all imported.

asr-003133
02:47:51.600 --> 02:47:52.860
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yung equipment nila,

asr-003134
02:47:53.020 --> 02:47:55.500
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: wala namang kubota ginagawa dito na tractor.

asr-003135
02:47:55.500 --> 02:47:57.040
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Lahat po ay galing Japan,

asr-003136
02:47:57.200 --> 02:47:59.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: China or the US,

asr-003137
02:47:59.400 --> 02:48:00.140
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ford tractors.

asr-003138
02:48:00.320 --> 02:48:01.460
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Everything is imported.

asr-003139
02:48:02.220 --> 02:48:04.240
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kaya naawa po ako sa ating mga magsasaka.

asr-003140
02:48:04.460 --> 02:48:07.380
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I think it's a perfect storm

asr-003141
02:48:07.380 --> 02:48:08.880
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: as you said earlier on the El Nino.

asr-003142
02:48:09.000 --> 02:48:10.300
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I think it's also a perfect storm

asr-003143
02:48:10.300 --> 02:48:13.620
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: na bumababa yung presyo ng value

asr-003144
02:48:13.620 --> 02:48:15.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: ng peso sa dollar.

asr-003145
02:48:15.760 --> 02:48:17.840
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Tapos tumataas pa ang presyo ng gasolina.

asr-003146
02:48:19.160 --> 02:48:19.820
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ang hirap.

asr-003147
02:48:20.140 --> 02:48:21.980
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ang hirap po ng situation ng sekretary.

asr-003148
02:48:22.060 --> 02:48:22.980
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I don't blame you, Sec.

asr-003149
02:48:23.220 --> 02:48:24.620
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: You know, pumapayat ka nga eh.

asr-003150
02:48:24.620 --> 02:48:26.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kaya naawa ako sir.

asr-003151
02:48:26.120 --> 02:48:26.780
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Pumapayat si sekretary.

asr-003152
02:48:27.200 --> 02:48:28.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Dati malusog yan.

asr-003153
02:48:29.040 --> 02:48:29.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ano yung pumapayat?

asr-003154
02:48:30.040 --> 02:48:31.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Dahil siguro sa stress yan.

asr-003155
02:48:32.040 --> 02:48:34.680
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, pinapatawa lang po kayo, Sec.

asr-003156
02:48:34.700 --> 02:48:35.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I don't want to put you in that seat.

asr-003157
02:48:36.020 --> 02:48:38.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We've been friends for 35 years.

asr-003158
02:48:39.040 --> 02:48:40.420
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, ang akin lang is,

asr-003159
02:48:41.360 --> 02:48:43.640
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I hope also that the House of Representatives

asr-003160
02:48:43.640 --> 02:48:45.520
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: take note of the bills that we passed

asr-003161
02:48:45.520 --> 02:48:48.100
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: on the extension services.

asr-003162
02:48:48.700 --> 02:48:51.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I think the secretary needs that law to be passed

asr-003163
02:48:51.160 --> 02:48:53.660
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: because the DA needs extension services

asr-003164
02:48:53.660 --> 02:48:55.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: to really go to the ground

asr-003165
02:48:55.200 --> 02:48:57.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and be felt in the ground.

asr-003166
02:48:57.200 --> 02:49:00.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We cannot just...

asr-003167
02:49:00.200 --> 02:49:01.400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Sorry na lang ha.

asr-003168
02:49:01.480 --> 02:49:06.300
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Makagalit sa akin yung mga PAO and mga MAO.

asr-003169
02:49:06.580 --> 02:49:08.080
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Municipal Agricultural Officers.

asr-003170
02:49:08.240 --> 02:49:09.920
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We need provincial agricultural officers.

asr-003171
02:49:10.460 --> 02:49:12.680
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: The DA needs people on the ground

asr-003172
02:49:12.680 --> 02:49:15.080
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: to tell them what is going on from the top.

asr-003173
02:49:15.800 --> 02:49:18.740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: What are the reforms being done on the ground?

asr-003174
02:49:18.900 --> 02:49:20.840
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kailangan talagang nilang sundalo sa baba.

asr-003175
02:49:21.620 --> 02:49:25.140
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, I just have one last if I may, Mr. Chairman.

asr-003176
02:49:25.320 --> 02:49:26.580
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Paano nila ako magsisecond round?

asr-003177
02:49:27.200 --> 02:49:29.080
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yes, thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-003178
02:49:29.760 --> 02:49:31.520
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Dito sa...

asr-003179
02:49:31.520 --> 02:49:36.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, at least, we talked about alternatives on fertilizers

asr-003180
02:49:36.000 --> 02:49:38.780
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and inputs from other countries.

asr-003181
02:49:39.060 --> 02:49:41.340
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We have to discuss how we can also tame

asr-003182
02:49:41.340 --> 02:49:45.180
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: the high inflation rates na talagang piktado

asr-003183
02:49:45.180 --> 02:49:46.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: yung taong bayan natin.

asr-003184
02:49:46.760 --> 02:49:49.820
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Also, due to the fact of the falling peso to the dollar.

asr-003185
02:49:51.960 --> 02:49:54.740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Some good news, Mr. Chairman, Mr. Secretary.

asr-003186
02:49:54.740 --> 02:49:56.280
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We passed the Kawayan Act,

asr-003187
02:49:56.580 --> 02:49:57.180
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: the Bamboo Law,

asr-003188
02:49:57.200 --> 02:49:58.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and we passed the DPR Act.

asr-003189
02:49:58.200 --> 02:49:58.240
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We passed the DPR Act.

asr-003190
02:49:58.240 --> 02:50:00.960
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Finally, both House and the Senate

asr-003191
02:50:00.960 --> 02:50:02.380
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: will be meeting during the break

asr-003192
02:50:02.380 --> 02:50:05.460
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: to come up with an acceptable language

asr-003193
02:50:05.460 --> 02:50:07.600
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: for the Bicameral Conference Committee report.

asr-003194
02:50:08.260 --> 02:50:10.500
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I think we're leaning towards the DA again

asr-003195
02:50:10.500 --> 02:50:17.900
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: as being the number one source of motivation

asr-003196
02:50:17.900 --> 02:50:20.280
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and moral support for this law to pass.

asr-003197
02:50:21.000 --> 02:50:25.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kasi matagal po yung away ninyo sa DNR, sa DTI, di ba po?

asr-003198
02:50:25.160 --> 02:50:26.680
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, ang ginawa po natin, ako,

asr-003199
02:50:27.200 --> 02:50:30.900
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: may bias to the DA because I'm also a resident agriculturist

asr-003200
02:50:30.900 --> 02:50:32.540
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and a licensed agriculturist at that.

asr-003201
02:50:33.180 --> 02:50:37.740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We can now promote high-value farming

asr-003202
02:50:37.740 --> 02:50:39.980
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: like with kawayan, bamboo.

asr-003203
02:50:40.760 --> 02:50:42.540
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yesterday, I was in Bay Laguna

asr-003204
02:50:42.540 --> 02:50:44.680
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: buying a bonsai, bogambilya.

asr-003205
02:50:45.440 --> 02:50:46.620
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Napaka-mahal.

asr-003206
02:50:46.900 --> 02:50:49.540
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: At sabi ko nga, isang bogambilya lang na maganda

asr-003207
02:50:49.540 --> 02:50:53.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: ay napaka-laki na ng income ng farmer na ito.

asr-003208
02:50:53.160 --> 02:50:56.100
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, I think we should start looking into other

asr-003209
02:50:56.100 --> 02:50:57.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: high-value companies.

asr-003210
02:50:57.200 --> 02:50:59.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We can also concentrate on plantation crops

asr-003211
02:50:59.940 --> 02:51:02.960
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: for our farmers para maiba din po yung dumami din po ito,

asr-003212
02:51:02.960 --> 02:51:04.820
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: lumakas po ang kanilang kita at benta.

asr-003213
02:51:05.000 --> 02:51:07.980
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, I hope we can also concentrate, Sec,

asr-003214
02:51:08.040 --> 02:51:12.380
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: not only on plantation crops like corn, like sugar,

asr-003215
02:51:12.820 --> 02:51:16.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: like, of course, rice.

asr-003216
02:51:17.360 --> 02:51:20.240
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We can look into high-value horticulture.

asr-003217
02:51:20.860 --> 02:51:23.980
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Sana po buhayin ninyo pong mga department,

asr-003218
02:51:24.180 --> 02:51:26.900
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: sa department, yung mga bureau ninyo ng horticulture

asr-003219
02:51:26.900 --> 02:51:27.760
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and high-value crops.

asr-003220
02:51:27.880 --> 02:51:30.780
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Nandyan si Usec Sheryl, high-value crops yan.

asr-003221
02:51:31.320 --> 02:51:32.900
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: That is a shining light.

asr-003222
02:51:33.740 --> 02:51:35.560
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Alam mo paano ko nahanap po, Mr. Chairman,

asr-003223
02:51:35.700 --> 02:51:36.660
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: yung bogambilya na yan?

asr-003224
02:51:37.280 --> 02:51:37.640
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Facebook.

asr-003225
02:51:38.400 --> 02:51:39.080
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Facebook lang.

asr-003226
02:51:39.180 --> 02:51:40.380
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Gagaling na nila mag-market.

asr-003227
02:51:40.640 --> 02:51:42.740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, pag nakita mo Facebook, nandyan yung address.

asr-003228
02:51:42.900 --> 02:51:44.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Puntahan ng mga buyers.

asr-003229
02:51:44.380 --> 02:51:46.720
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: They told me they, because of Facebook market,

asr-003230
02:51:46.940 --> 02:51:48.860
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: ang dami po nilang naibibenta.

asr-003231
02:51:49.000 --> 02:51:51.480
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, there are other opportunities for farmers

asr-003232
02:51:51.480 --> 02:51:54.580
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: with small areas that can make a lot of money.

asr-003233
02:51:54.960 --> 02:51:56.400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, we can look into that.

asr-003234
02:51:56.400 --> 02:51:57.400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Because at the end of the day,

asr-003235
02:51:57.480 --> 02:52:00.280
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: ang gusto po natin, taasan po ang kita ng ating mga magsasaka.

asr-003236
02:52:00.520 --> 02:52:03.280
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: At hindi lamang po silang nakabinbin,

asr-003237
02:52:03.480 --> 02:52:07.020
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: nakasalalay sa isang monocrop.

asr-003238
02:52:07.240 --> 02:52:09.300
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I hope that we can do that also, Secretary.

asr-003239
02:52:09.640 --> 02:52:11.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: May we just ask for a comment from the Secretary?

asr-003240
02:52:12.620 --> 02:52:16.440
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Definitely, Mr. Chair, horticulture is on the agenda.

asr-003241
02:52:17.100 --> 02:52:18.860
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: We have a small budget for that.

asr-003242
02:52:19.240 --> 02:52:23.340
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Plus, the DA, along with the DTI and other government agencies,

asr-003243
02:52:23.340 --> 02:52:26.360
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: we're actually sponsoring sa Japan,

asr-003244
02:52:26.400 --> 02:52:33.660
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: we will have a major booth in a horticulture show in Yokohama in March 2027.

asr-003245
02:52:33.800 --> 02:52:36.280
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Maybe may imbita ko kayo doon.

asr-003246
02:52:36.560 --> 02:52:45.260
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At I really see, personally see that horticulture is an alternative business

asr-003247
02:52:45.260 --> 02:52:49.020
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: for our farmers and fisher folks.

asr-003248
02:52:49.380 --> 02:52:54.140
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Meron niyang mga plants na binibenta for 20,000 pesos, 10,000 pesos,

asr-003249
02:52:54.140 --> 02:52:55.900
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: or kids man, o ganoon.

asr-003250
02:52:56.400 --> 02:52:59.880
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Even baka sa Benguet, pwede na magkaroon ng tulips,

asr-003251
02:53:00.020 --> 02:53:02.200
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: yung type na ganoon, at magaganda pa.

asr-003252
02:53:02.560 --> 02:53:03.800
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Magandang pag-asa dyan.

asr-003253
02:53:04.280 --> 02:53:10.360
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Nakita ko sa ibang bansa na well-regulated and well-developed yan,

asr-003254
02:53:10.440 --> 02:53:11.460
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: kaya tulad ng Thailand.

asr-003255
02:53:12.700 --> 02:53:17.440
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So gusto nating tularan yun at maging major industry din.

asr-003256
02:53:17.540 --> 02:53:17.940
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Thank you, sir.

asr-003257
02:53:18.200 --> 02:53:18.500
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you.

asr-003258
02:53:18.580 --> 02:53:21.180
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kasi ako, Mr. Chairman, may ilig ako sa ornamental plants.

asr-003259
02:53:21.180 --> 02:53:23.620
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So tama po sinabi yung Secretary, orchids.

asr-003260
02:53:23.960 --> 02:53:26.180
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: As a matter of fact, namili po ako nung isang araw ng May,

asr-003261
02:53:26.400 --> 02:53:32.380
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: maple trees, yung mga maple plants na yung nga lang mukhang mariwana,

asr-003262
02:53:32.540 --> 02:53:35.340
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: baka marid bigla yung farm ko, pero hindi mariwana yun.

asr-003263
02:53:35.640 --> 02:53:37.740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Maple trees yun na seedlings.

asr-003264
02:53:38.140 --> 02:53:40.460
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ba, tagwa 1,500 din, kada isa, 1,000.

asr-003265
02:53:40.720 --> 02:53:42.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So laki din ang income.

asr-003266
02:53:42.440 --> 02:53:46.620
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So tama po si Secretary, there's a lot of things that we can do here in the Philippines

asr-003267
02:53:46.620 --> 02:53:51.580
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: that can really augment the farmers, not only focusing on our plantation crops.

asr-003268
02:53:52.200 --> 02:53:56.360
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And finally, Mr. Chairman, so ayong information sa kawayan, Secretary,

asr-003269
02:53:56.400 --> 02:53:59.540
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: malapit na po yan, baka matulungan niyo po kami.

asr-003270
02:53:59.640 --> 02:54:03.100
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We're leaning towards the DAS, the Implementing Agency for that SEC.

asr-003271
02:54:03.280 --> 02:54:04.180
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Okay lang po sa inyo yan.

asr-003272
02:54:04.440 --> 02:54:13.060
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: We support that fully and I'm an avid believer in the bamboo industry and its benefits, Mr. Chair.

asr-003273
02:54:13.560 --> 02:54:14.020
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you.

asr-003274
02:54:14.160 --> 02:54:19.720
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Oo nga, kasi yung pati nga airport namin sa Bukidnon, we're retrofitting it with bamboo inside.

asr-003275
02:54:19.720 --> 02:54:25.000
