asr-003283
02:54:45.280 --> 02:54:48.480
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: They buy whatever they can produce there na bamboo.

asr-003284
02:54:48.660 --> 02:54:50.640
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: At magagandang pong farmgate prices nila.

asr-003285
02:54:51.180 --> 02:54:53.400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So marami po kaming farmers, Mr. Chairman.

asr-003286
02:54:54.160 --> 02:54:56.360
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Dati, ang subsistence farmgate.

asr-003287
02:54:56.400 --> 02:54:59.680
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Farmers lang po sila, corn and plant rice.

asr-003288
02:54:59.840 --> 02:55:00.820
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ngayon, bamboo na sila.

asr-003289
02:55:00.880 --> 02:55:02.740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: They're making a lot of money out of the bamboo.

asr-003290
02:55:03.200 --> 02:55:07.460
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And tamas talaga yung kanilang livelihood opportunities, Your Honor.

asr-003291
02:55:07.540 --> 02:55:11.280
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So finally, I will be remiss to ask, if I don't ask this,

asr-003292
