asr-003293
02:55:14.160 --> 02:55:15.920
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: pero originally taga Negro-Soxidental.

asr-003294
02:55:16.640 --> 02:55:21.420
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kamag-anak ko yan, na malayo, si Paul Ascuna, yung inyong SRA chairman,

asr-003295
02:55:22.420 --> 02:55:24.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: on the RSSI.

asr-003296
02:55:24.780 --> 02:55:26.380
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kami natamaan din po kami sa Bukidnon.

asr-003297
02:55:26.460 --> 02:55:30.540
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We appreciate a lot of the work that SRA has been doing.

asr-003298
02:55:30.680 --> 02:55:34.360
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We're just seeking more support from the mother organization, the DA,

asr-003299
02:55:34.960 --> 02:55:36.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: and the DSWD.

asr-003300
02:55:36.240 --> 02:55:39.220
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We'd like to thank Secretary Rex Gatchalian,

asr-003301
02:55:39.340 --> 02:55:42.420
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: nagbigay po siya ng tulong sa mga farmers na natamaan ng RSSI.

asr-003302
02:55:43.200 --> 02:55:45.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ito po, sa marami pong nanunood na yan,

asr-003303
02:55:45.300 --> 02:55:51.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: at nakikinig, yung RSSI, ito po isang peste na tumatama po sa atin sa industriya ng tubo.

asr-003304
02:55:51.320 --> 02:55:54.620
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Bukidnon is the second largest producer of sugar in the country,

asr-003305
02:55:54.620 --> 02:55:56.380
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: next to Negro-Soxidental.

asr-003306
02:55:56.400 --> 02:56:01.760
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And malaking epekto po ito, chairman, sa ating mga magsasaka.

asr-003307
02:56:02.260 --> 02:56:04.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Pag natamaan po silang ginagawa po nila,

asr-003308
02:56:04.460 --> 02:56:12.660
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: itong SRA na pesting ito, kinakain po nila yung dahon ng mga tubo ng tanim.

asr-003309
02:56:13.200 --> 02:56:19.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: At dahil dyan, napakalaki ng gastos, of course, if you use pesticides for the prevention of this.

asr-003310
02:56:20.860 --> 02:56:24.060
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kung sa Bisaya, padayon lang po, padayon sa inyong programa.

asr-003311
02:56:24.060 --> 02:56:25.540
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: At tuloy nyo lang po.

asr-003312
02:56:26.400 --> 02:56:29.800
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We just want you to know that we don't want to kill the sugar industry as well.

asr-003313
02:56:30.500 --> 02:56:33.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: We want to make sure that the sugar industry survives.

asr-003314
02:56:33.800 --> 02:56:39.300
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: This is still a very important product for our people, lalo na sa mga farmers.

asr-003315
02:56:39.920 --> 02:56:46.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And this time, 90% po, dati ka po sinabi nyo po, sugar farmers, mga hasyendero.

asr-003316
02:56:46.600 --> 02:56:49.820
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ngayon po, 90% po ay small farmers.

asr-003317
02:56:49.940 --> 02:56:52.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: These are agrarian reform beneficiaries.

asr-003318
