asr-003329
02:57:31.480 --> 02:57:36.580
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yes po, we've been fighting RSSI for a couple of years in Luzon

asr-003330
02:57:36.580 --> 02:57:40.040
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: and in Negros, two years in Bukidnon.

asr-003331
02:57:40.160 --> 02:57:41.020
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: This is the first year.

asr-003332
02:57:41.600 --> 02:57:45.660
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Last year, we tried our best to quarantine Bukidnon

asr-003333
02:57:45.660 --> 02:57:49.540
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: and protect it from RSSI coming from Negros.

asr-003334
02:57:49.540 --> 02:57:54.820
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: However, it arrived in Davao and somehow made its way to Bukidnon.

asr-003335
02:57:55.480 --> 02:57:55.680
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Now,

asr-003336
02:57:56.400 --> 02:58:01.360
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: yes, we do need more support, especially budget-wise.

asr-003337
02:58:01.360 --> 02:58:09.980
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: We greatly appreciate the help of the DA by extending budget down to SRA to help.

asr-003338
02:58:10.740 --> 02:58:14.160
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Concurrently, we're using pesticides, which is very expensive.

asr-003339
02:58:14.800 --> 02:58:20.360
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: However, the Secretary already came up with a program wherein LGUs,

asr-003340
02:58:21.220 --> 02:58:25.200
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: farmer associations, our meal district development councils,

asr-003341
02:58:25.380 --> 02:58:26.080
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: which are private,

asr-003342
02:58:26.400 --> 02:58:33.740
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: and other organizations are encouraged to make their own biocontrol laboratories.

asr-003343
02:58:34.680 --> 02:58:39.860
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: SRA and the DA will provide the fungi, the mother fungi,

asr-003344
02:58:40.220 --> 02:58:45.620
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: that we have tested, and it's proven to help control RSSI.

asr-003345
02:58:45.800 --> 02:58:47.580
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: It's a lot slower than pesticide,

asr-003346
02:58:47.580 --> 02:58:50.860
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: but we need to bring it down to the grassroots level,

asr-003347
02:58:51.600 --> 02:58:52.760
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Senator and Mr. Chair,

asr-003348
02:58:53.120 --> 02:58:56.380
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: to make it accessible.

asr-003349
02:58:56.400 --> 02:59:03.160
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So, I think with your help, with the Chairman's help,

asr-003350
02:59:03.500 --> 02:59:04.920
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: we do need budget for it.

asr-003351
02:59:06.260 --> 02:59:13.500
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: There were already LGUs in Negros who signified that they are willing to go

asr-003352
02:59:13.500 --> 02:59:16.280
