asr-003353
02:59:16.600 --> 02:59:18.120
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: This is for the future use.

asr-003354
02:59:18.540 --> 02:59:20.940
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: We believe RSSI will be here to stay.

asr-003355
02:59:21.060 --> 02:59:22.900
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: It's very hard to totally eradicate.

asr-003356
02:59:22.900 --> 02:59:25.700
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: But we just, according to the countries who

asr-003357
02:59:26.400 --> 02:59:28.560
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: had RSSI or still have RSSI,

asr-003358
02:59:28.900 --> 02:59:32.440
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: we just have to learn and live with it and control it in the biocontrol way.

asr-003359
02:59:32.520 --> 02:59:35.000
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: We cannot continually use chemical pesticides.

asr-003360
02:59:35.740 --> 02:59:36.960
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: It is not sustainable.

asr-003361
02:59:37.240 --> 02:59:39.400
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: So, hopefully, hopefully,

asr-003362
