asr-004818
04:18:10.200 --> 04:18:21.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: How do we ensure, again, that our local farmers are not at the disadvantage as we bring in the necessary supply of corn?

asr-004819
04:18:21.280 --> 04:18:23.400
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Meron tayong pwedeng sistema.

asr-004820
04:18:23.420 --> 04:18:32.620
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Pardon na, yung MAV, yung MAV, hindi natin i-issue during harvest season, no, ng ating mga corn farmers,

asr-004821
04:18:32.740 --> 04:18:36.020
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: and it only will be utilized after harvest season, Mr. Chair.

asr-004822
04:18:36.620 --> 04:18:37.700
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Major harvest season.

asr-004823
04:18:39.740 --> 04:18:45.500
