asr-004825
04:18:47.640 --> 04:18:47.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-004826
04:18:47.920 --> 04:18:48.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-004827
04:18:50.140 --> 04:18:50.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ah.

asr-004828
04:18:53.420 --> 04:18:54.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

