Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sa PCC, Philippine Carabao Center,

asr-004830
04:19:04.600 --> 04:19:11.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: kumusta yung inyong obligation and disbursement nung binadjet natin sa gatas?

asr-004831
