asr-004832
04:19:16.960 --> 04:19:18.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasi tama ba ito?

asr-004833
04:19:23.420 --> 04:19:25.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 35%.

asr-004834
04:19:25.920 --> 04:19:39.300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Your target is supposed to be 8 million milk packs, but you only delivered 2.8 million.

asr-004835
