PCC Executive Director Liza G. Batad: Already by 80.04%.

asr-004847
04:20:28.120 --> 04:20:31.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Again, again, sorry.

asr-004848
04:20:33.420 --> 04:20:37.160
PCC Executive Director Liza G. Batad: Ah, it has increased already at 80%.

asr-004849
