asr-004864
04:21:29.800 --> 04:21:33.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay. Pero, binawasan yung inyong budget for...

asr-004865
04:21:33.540 --> 04:21:33.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Opo.

asr-004866
04:21:34.100 --> 04:21:40.180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Oh, how will that affect the, yung, ah, industry, yung dairy?

asr-004867
04:21:41.120 --> 04:21:52.560
PCC Executive Director Liza G. Batad: Ah, it will, it will, it is reduced at 449, ah, from 100, ah, from 1.12 billion.

asr-004868
04:21:53.340 --> 04:21:58.140
PCC Executive Director Liza G. Batad: So, kalahati, less than kalahati po ang binigay.

asr-004869
04:21:58.380 --> 04:21:58.820
PCC Executive Director Liza G. Batad: One-third.

asr-004870
04:21:58.980 --> 04:22:08.040
PCC Executive Director Liza G. Batad: Ah, definitely, ah, the, the farming families or farming carabao raisers and cooperatives will be affected.

asr-004871
04:22:08.040 --> 04:22:12.040
PCC Executive Director Liza G. Batad: Ah, mababawasan po ng...

asr-004872
04:22:13.460 --> 04:22:16.240
PCC Executive Director Liza G. Batad: Okay, Secretary will answer.

asr-004873
04:22:16.240 --> 04:22:16.960
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: May I answer that, Mr. Chair?

asr-004874
04:22:16.960 --> 04:22:18.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, please. Go ahead, sir.

asr-004875
04:22:18.080 --> 04:22:23.200
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ah, yan yung binabanggit kong problema dun sa IDECA na 20 billion.

asr-004876
04:22:23.340 --> 04:22:28.720
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kaya nabawasan yung mga major programs nila dahil nga meron na kami 20 billion, eh.

asr-004877
04:22:29.140 --> 04:22:30.820
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But then, hindi nga namin magagamit ito.

asr-004878
04:22:30.940 --> 04:22:34.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, parang sa amin nga tanggalin ito at ibalik lang dati ito.

asr-004879
04:22:34.200 --> 04:22:39.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Then, ah, so that tuloy-tuloy lang ang programa ng livestock group, Mr. Chair.

asr-004880
04:22:39.640 --> 04:22:45.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sorry, ah, hindi siya magagamit dahil, forgive my, you know, sa dami nung...

asr-004881
04:22:46.060 --> 04:22:47.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasi hindi pa siya na...

asr-004882
04:22:48.080 --> 04:22:51.800
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sa, hindi na. For the restructuring, ah, we have to hire more people.

asr-004883
04:22:51.800 --> 04:22:53.000
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yung organizational chart.

asr-004884
04:22:53.000 --> 04:22:54.520
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Plantilla, kailangan maset.

asr-004885
04:22:55.040 --> 04:22:58.740
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And on timelines namin, it has to go to, ah, civil service.

asr-004886
04:22:58.860 --> 04:23:00.020
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: It has to go through DBM.

asr-004887
04:23:00.300 --> 04:23:02.100
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: It has to go through other...

asr-004888
04:23:02.100 --> 04:23:03.360
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: May back and forth pa yan.

asr-004889
04:23:03.480 --> 04:23:08.140
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, November next year pa namin magagamit yung 20 billion na IDECA.

asr-004890
04:23:08.720 --> 04:23:08.960
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Okay.

asr-004891
04:23:09.120 --> 04:23:15.860
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, we, that's the formal request was made that, ah, we forego of the 20 billion of the IDECA

asr-004892
04:23:15.860 --> 04:23:21.860
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: and revert back to our original NEP na wala yung IDECA.

asr-004893
04:23:22.000 --> 04:23:22.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Understood. Understood.

asr-004894
04:23:23.000 --> 04:23:30.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ibig sabihin, ah, kung dalawang buwan na lang sa January, sa 2027 magagamit, what's the point?

asr-004895
04:23:31.080 --> 04:23:31.160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Diba?

asr-004896
04:23:32.660 --> 04:23:35.300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay. Okay. We will note that.

asr-004897
04:23:42.540 --> 04:23:43.160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-004898
04:23:43.160 --> 04:23:43.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, sir.

asr-004899
