05:33:54.360 --> 05:33:56.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: O pinilit? O sumunod? Meron ba?

asr-006058
05:33:57.260 --> 05:34:00.660
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasi iba yung sabi nga ninyo, na-delay.

asr-006059
05:34:01.280 --> 05:34:03.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Dapat yan July, pero September na.

asr-006060
05:34:04.340 --> 05:34:10.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, are you, is there an internal investigation?

asr-006061
05:34:11.460 --> 05:34:20.180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: In fairness to the Secretary, as you said publicly, you're the one who put a stop to the entry.

asr-006062
05:34:20.180 --> 05:34:31.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And precisely because of these errors or non-compliance with the permits.

asr-006063
05:34:33.200 --> 05:34:35.520
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And so how are we moving forward?

asr-006064
05:34:35.960 --> 05:34:37.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ito ang tinatanong din.

asr-006065
05:34:40.140 --> 05:34:42.860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And I'm sure tatanongin ito sa plenary.

asr-006066
05:34:43.980 --> 05:34:45.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Go ahead, sir.

asr-006067
05:34:45.020 --> 05:34:47.320
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair.

asr-006068
05:34:48.160 --> 05:34:50.020
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yung sa limay, umpisa ako sa limay.

asr-006069
05:34:50.180 --> 05:34:57.540
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: As far as we are concerned, from my review with our Bureau of Plant, our DAIE,

asr-006070
05:34:58.320 --> 05:35:01.420
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: wala silang nakikitang issue sa documents.

asr-006071
05:35:02.380 --> 05:35:09.940
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yung sinasabing tampering, binanggit ng isang broadcaster, wala kaming nakita.

asr-006072
05:35:11.300 --> 05:35:16.580
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Meron din sinasabi na yung must-depart date, hindi na meet.

asr-006073
05:35:16.580 --> 05:35:19.580
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But then the bill of lading issued by the shipping company,

asr-006074
05:35:20.180 --> 05:35:22.220
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: was August 31.

asr-006075
05:35:23.020 --> 05:35:28.260
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At yung must-depart date, mas load or mas anong date is September 1.

asr-006076
05:35:28.760 --> 05:35:29.640
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, pasok din.

asr-006077
05:35:30.380 --> 05:35:32.600
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, it's a BOC matter now.

asr-006078
05:35:33.480 --> 05:35:41.600
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, in my opinion, it's BOC ngayon na mag-husga or mag-ahatol kung ano mangyayari sa shipment na ito.

asr-006079
05:35:41.760 --> 05:35:47.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And this is a private company that imported the cargo.

asr-006080
05:35:47.180 --> 05:35:50.140
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And walang kinalaman dito ang Department.

asr-006081
05:35:50.180 --> 05:35:54.020
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And the agriculture, except for issuance of an SPSIC.

asr-006082
05:35:55.560 --> 05:36:01.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: As far as the, ano naman, doon sa Davao, which I am being attacked.

asr-006083
05:36:01.080 --> 05:36:03.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Before lang, sorry, just before Davao.

asr-006084
05:36:04.520 --> 05:36:09.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I remember this in 2011, subik din yung pagpasok ng bigas.

asr-006085
05:36:10.120 --> 05:36:12.520
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Na dapat transshipment lang.

asr-006086
05:36:13.180 --> 05:36:14.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yun ang sinasabi.

asr-006087
05:36:14.000 --> 05:36:17.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pero, hindi nga transshipment.

asr-006088
05:36:17.640 --> 05:36:20.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Tsaka kung itatransship mo, ba't mo idadaan dito?

asr-006089
05:36:20.180 --> 05:36:23.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, may mga ganong problema nun.

asr-006090
05:36:24.060 --> 05:36:26.100
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kaya, parang nag-ano lang sa akin.

asr-006091
05:36:26.760 --> 05:36:28.100
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Is this a repeat?

asr-006092
05:36:28.920 --> 05:36:33.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Iba yung dokumento ng BOC, iba yung dokumento ng DA.

asr-006093
05:36:35.360 --> 05:36:44.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But, please allow us, submit some of the documents that you're mentioning about the entry.

asr-006094
05:36:45.400 --> 05:36:49.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasi, yun nga, ang concern natin dito is, again,

asr-006095
05:36:50.180 --> 05:36:55.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: diba, medyo may concern doon sa documentation.

asr-006096
05:36:55.640 --> 05:36:58.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: At least, yun ang na-relay sa akin.

asr-006097
05:36:58.660 --> 05:37:00.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But, go ahead, sir.

asr-006098
05:37:01.360 --> 05:37:04.360
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Che, we will submit all the reports about that, Limay.

asr-006099
05:37:04.960 --> 05:37:08.840
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: As far as the vessel Tyson 2 naman, ano sa Davao.

asr-006100
05:37:09.440 --> 05:37:12.660
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ulitin ko lang, ako ho ang nagpa-cancel ng SPSIC.

asr-006101
05:37:12.940 --> 05:37:14.880
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ako ang nagpahuli ng barko.

asr-006102
05:37:15.560 --> 05:37:18.700
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ako rin ang isa sa nag-decide to cease the cargo.

asr-006103
05:37:19.220 --> 05:37:20.160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Para malaman talaga.

asr-006104
05:37:20.180 --> 05:37:24.140
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ang katotohanan, along with Commissioner Ariel Anipa-Moceno.

asr-006105
05:37:24.720 --> 05:37:28.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, clearly, na nakikita sa social media, I am clearly under attack.

asr-006106
05:37:28.840 --> 05:37:30.660
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: For what reasons, I really don't know.

asr-006107
05:37:31.160 --> 05:37:34.200
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But, I can only smell the hands of smugglers.

asr-006108
05:37:35.020 --> 05:37:41.760
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Na tinira namin dati at nasa order of battle namin dito sa DA.

asr-006109
05:37:42.500 --> 05:37:48.140
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: At marami akong pinakancel na kumpanya nung particular smuggling group na to.

asr-006110
05:37:48.140 --> 05:37:50.140
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, I will even name the names.

asr-006111
05:37:50.180 --> 05:37:55.600
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: The name, not the name, but the so-called AKA of this group.

asr-006112
05:37:55.760 --> 05:37:57.840
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: It's a, tawag sa kanya, JOSOL group.

asr-006113
05:37:58.660 --> 05:38:03.520
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yung specific person na yan, I really do not know who they are.

asr-006114
05:38:03.780 --> 05:38:06.220
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But, yan ang intel na nakukuha namin.

asr-006115
05:38:07.040 --> 05:38:14.480
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, basically, malinaw sa akin that I must be doing something right to get this flak.

asr-006116
05:38:14.800 --> 05:38:17.680
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And, twist, tinitwist pa yung katotohanan.

asr-006117
05:38:17.680 --> 05:38:20.020
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And, totoo lang, boss, sir.

asr-006118
05:38:20.180 --> 05:38:22.920
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Senator, may resibo ako.

asr-006119
05:38:23.860 --> 05:38:31.840
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Andito lahat ng text ko to instruct BPI, instruct the Bureau of Fisheries, instruct DAIE.

asr-006120
05:38:32.480 --> 05:38:34.660
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: In all the details here, makikita nyo.

asr-006121
05:38:35.400 --> 05:38:39.980
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ito, cancel this SPSIC ASAP, September 9.

asr-006122
05:38:40.220 --> 05:38:43.220
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kakaalis pa lang ng vessel sa Vietnam on September 8.

asr-006123
05:38:43.620 --> 05:38:48.680
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sinabi ng tao, sinabi sa akin, may nagtanong sa social media,

asr-006124
05:38:48.800 --> 05:38:49.160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Bakit?

asr-006125
05:38:50.180 --> 05:38:52.760
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Nasa India ako noon.

asr-006126
05:38:53.680 --> 05:38:57.800
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And, nag-react lang ako based on a tip from industry players mismo.

asr-006127
05:38:58.660 --> 05:39:03.820
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: On September 18, meron akong text din dito,

asr-006128
05:39:04.680 --> 05:39:06.140
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: which tinatrack namin yung vessel.

asr-006129
05:39:06.640 --> 05:39:08.700
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Tinatrack namin daily, sinasamalis yan eh.

asr-006130
05:39:10.180 --> 05:39:12.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sabi ko kay Ethos to,

asr-006131
05:39:12.760 --> 05:39:16.100
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Bantayan, please tell Ethos and send DAA, wag i-allow.

asr-006132
05:39:16.860 --> 05:39:18.320
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Wag i-allow i-unload.

asr-006133
05:39:18.460 --> 05:39:20.160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I heard they are planning to smuggle it.

asr-006134
05:39:20.180 --> 05:39:23.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But, of course, I heard lang.

asr-006135
05:39:23.180 --> 05:39:24.820
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I'm not sure if they are planning or not.

asr-006136
05:39:25.620 --> 05:39:28.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Maraming kinausap dito, including Bureau of Customs.

asr-006137
05:39:29.100 --> 05:39:33.540
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But, ang information ko, Bureau of Customs refused to dance.

asr-006138
05:39:34.580 --> 05:39:40.800
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, meaning, yung ating customs ay tinindigan na hindi sila papayag sa mga ganyan.

asr-006139
05:39:41.740 --> 05:39:43.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Andito ho, recibo ho yan.

asr-006140
05:39:44.080 --> 05:39:49.080
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Then, meron pa ako ditong text, September 19 naman.

asr-006141
05:39:50.180 --> 05:39:51.880
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: To BIFAR Director.

asr-006142
05:39:52.700 --> 05:39:56.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Please send BIFAR boat on this vessel to see if nag-unload.

asr-006143
05:39:57.060 --> 05:40:00.860
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Then, on the same day, September 19,

asr-006144
05:40:01.440 --> 05:40:04.680
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: ang instruction ko na kay Director Salilig at USEC Truce,

asr-006145
05:40:05.200 --> 05:40:08.920
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: hulihin na ang vessel Tyson 2 at dalhin sa General Santos Fishport.

asr-006146
05:40:09.380 --> 05:40:11.740
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Bigas laman nito na cancelled SPSIC.

asr-006147
05:40:12.320 --> 05:40:17.120
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Hulihin na and makita naman natin kung puno pa or hindi na.

asr-006148
05:40:17.280 --> 05:40:19.140
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kasi alam natin ang load nito.

asr-006149
05:40:19.140 --> 05:40:20.100
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, tapos,

asr-006150
05:40:20.180 --> 05:40:24.240
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: sumagot si USEC Bayate sa akin na after a few minutes,

asr-006151
05:40:24.320 --> 05:40:28.460
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: 10.36 to 11.20 AM,

asr-006152
05:40:29.160 --> 05:40:37.140
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: SEC apprehended na ng Navy ang vessel according to OIC BIFAR Director 12.

asr-006153
05:40:37.680 --> 05:40:38.940
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Then, I have the pictures.

asr-006154
05:40:39.720 --> 05:40:40.820
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Tinanong ko na saan na.

asr-006155
05:40:41.420 --> 05:40:49.020
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I even sent a boat from my family's operations in General Santos to look for the vessel.

asr-006156
05:40:49.020 --> 05:40:50.020
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And take pictures.

asr-006157
05:40:50.180 --> 05:40:52.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Talagang hinanap namin.

asr-006158
05:40:52.180 --> 05:40:54.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, kumpleto ho yan.

asr-006159
05:40:54.180 --> 05:40:57.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So, kung ano man ang iniisip ng mga tao about,

asr-006160
05:40:57.180 --> 05:41:00.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: o yung mga tira sa akin,

asr-006161
05:41:00.180 --> 05:41:02.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: yung totoong, it's all lies.

asr-006162
05:41:02.180 --> 05:41:05.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: It's all fake news.

asr-006163
05:41:05.180 --> 05:41:08.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Twisted to hit me and want to get me out of this.

asr-006164
05:41:08.180 --> 05:41:13.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I will be submitting this to your office, Mr. Chair. May kopya kami ngayon.

asr-006165
05:41:14.180 --> 05:41:18.200
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: For your review and siguro sa review ng ibang kasamahan natin dito.

asr-006166
05:41:18.200 --> 05:41:20.700
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I just wanted to explain to clear the air, Mr. Chair.

asr-006169
05:41:21.180 --> 05:41:22.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, huling hirit na lang.

asr-006170
05:41:22.180 --> 05:41:27.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi nung una, sinabi yata ng BPI na i-o-auction.

asr-006171
05:41:27.180 --> 05:41:30.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero sabi ni Secretary, ito sa media lang.

asr-006172
05:41:30.180 --> 05:41:35.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang pagkabalita, sabi sa diaryo na sabi ni Secretary,

asr-006173
05:41:35.180 --> 05:41:38.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: huwag nang i-auction at baka mabalik lang sa mga smuggler.

asr-006174
05:41:38.180 --> 05:41:41.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I-donate na lamang. Tama ba ito?

asr-006175
05:41:41.180 --> 05:41:45.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung cease-trize sa DSWD para makatulong sa mga pamilya.

asr-006176
05:41:45.180 --> 05:41:46.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-006177
05:41:46.180 --> 05:41:49.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ang nag-suggest yata through media, no?

asr-006178
05:41:49.180 --> 05:41:51.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I'm not sure kung talagang sinabi nila.

asr-006179
05:41:51.180 --> 05:41:57.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Nakita ko lang sa media na sinasabi na BOC wants to auction it.

asr-006180
05:41:57.180 --> 05:41:58.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tama.

asr-006181
05:41:58.180 --> 05:42:02.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ang sagot ko naman kay Mr. Ted Filon is ayoko i-auction.

asr-006182
05:42:02.180 --> 05:42:06.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: It's either distractions, go back to sender,

asr-006183
05:42:06.180 --> 05:42:10.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: or ibigay sa DSWD para pamigay sa taong bayan ng libre.

asr-006184
05:42:10.180 --> 05:42:13.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So ano na ang latest na nangyari?

asr-006185
05:42:13.180 --> 05:42:15.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ano na ang latest update sa bigas mismo?

asr-006186
05:42:15.180 --> 05:42:18.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: In our opinion kasi, ngayon kasi tinitignan namin mabuti yung mga files.

asr-006187
05:42:18.180 --> 05:42:25.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: May latest report ako, nandun din yata sa report na bibigay ko sa inyo.

asr-006188
05:42:25.180 --> 05:42:31.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kaya ako pinahuli yan is umalis yung vessel nung September 18 sa Gensan.

asr-006189
05:42:31.180 --> 05:42:33.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Akala ko tatakbo.

asr-006190
05:42:33.180 --> 05:42:42.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But then now, there is a document now that shows a report from the vessel owner to the vessel agent

asr-006191
05:42:42.180 --> 05:42:46.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: that says that at 8.30 am on September 18,

asr-006192
05:42:46.180 --> 05:42:52.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: the postcard vessel instructed na pumunta ang vessel to Gensan.

asr-006193
05:42:52.180 --> 05:42:54.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Andito rin iyon.

asr-006194
05:42:54.180 --> 05:42:56.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: It's an email.

asr-006195
05:42:56.180 --> 05:42:58.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So ito we will supply to you.

asr-006196
05:42:58.180 --> 05:42:59.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pakibigay na rin.

asr-006197
05:42:59.180 --> 05:43:02.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So ibig sabihin, medyo may good faith sila.

asr-006198
05:43:02.180 --> 05:43:04.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kasi natatrack naman yung vessel eh.

asr-006199
05:43:04.180 --> 05:43:06.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: It's an international tracking eh.

asr-006200
05:43:06.180 --> 05:43:08.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Tapos meron naman nagpapuntang Gensan.

asr-006201
05:43:08.180 --> 05:43:10.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: May humuli sa Gensan.

asr-006202
05:43:10.180 --> 05:43:12.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But it doesn't mean na may foul play.

asr-006203
05:43:12.180 --> 05:43:15.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kung yung cargo as declared in the SPIC is the same,

asr-006204
05:43:15.180 --> 05:43:17.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: it means walang kalokohan eh.

asr-006205
05:43:17.180 --> 05:43:20.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So maybe there is grounds for good faith.

asr-006206
05:43:20.180 --> 05:43:22.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But in case may kalokohan ngayon,

asr-006207
05:43:22.180 --> 05:43:27.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: ang pinakamaganda i-seize yan at i-distribute sa taong bayan.

asr-006208
05:43:27.180 --> 05:43:32.180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Siguro the question is, bakit PPI ang consignee?

asr-006209
05:43:32.180 --> 05:43:35.180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So yun yung...

asr-006210
05:43:35.180 --> 05:43:39.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ang masagot ko naman, Mr. Chair, dyan is

asr-006211
05:43:39.180 --> 05:43:43.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: from my investigation, although PPI is independent,

asr-006212
05:43:43.180 --> 05:43:46.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: I do not run PPI on a day-to-day basis,

asr-006213
05:43:46.180 --> 05:43:50.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: nor do I make pakialam in their operations

asr-006214
05:43:50.180 --> 05:43:53.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: because I'm just an ex-officio nga.

asr-006215
05:43:53.180 --> 05:43:56.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: But of course, nag-inimbestigahan ko rin sila.

asr-006216
05:43:56.180 --> 05:43:59.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Imagine, ako na nga yung ex-officio ng PPI.

asr-006217
05:43:59.180 --> 05:44:01.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Alam ko na PPI yan.

asr-006218
05:44:01.180 --> 05:44:04.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Alam ko PPI din yung consignee.

asr-006219
05:44:04.180 --> 05:44:06.180
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Ako pa rin ang pahinto.

asr-006220
05:44:06.180 --> 05:44:10.180
